    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Furrykin (Mustelid)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You know where the earth is soft, even when it looks like stone.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Tunnelcraft.</strong> You ignore difficult terrain in caves, tunnels, rubble, and ruins. In BBTTCC travel, your party treats one ‘blocked’ route segment as ‘passable’ once per Turn if you lead (GM/system).</p>",
